    "https://github.com/djynnius/ferraus/blob/main/docs/decisions",
    "https://djynnius.github.io/ferraus"
  ],
  "saferAlternatives": [
    "Start the server with --allow set to one music folder: path arguments outside it fail with path_not_allowed, and outputs default to ferraus-out/ inside it.",
    "Keep ferraus_job_start, ferraus_pipeline_run and ferraus_replay on Review: each runs other ferraus tools, so an inherited call could reach a reviewed one.",
    "Leave models.auto_download off (the default) so ML tools fail with exit code 5 instead of downloading; separate, denoise, tune, analyze_pitch, transcribe, score_read and fx stay on Review either way.",
    "Prefer ferraus_convert and the ferraus_media_* tools, whose paths are checked, to ferraus_ffmpeg and ferraus_ffprobe, which pass their arguments straight to FFmpeg.",
    "Plugin tools and plugin:<name> instruments (render, score_perform, hum, vocoder carriers) run installed CLAP/VST3 code in a separate host process with a watchdog.",
    "Models and sounds are SHA-256 checked against Ed25519-signed registries; sounds without a pinned hash are refused unless FERRAUS_ALLOW_UNVERIFIED=1 is set."
  ]
}
